			"notes": {
				"rationale": "vielen Dank is one of Duden's thanks formulas, so it takes the 🙏 of danke. Its head word Dank governs für (Duden Dank: Anerkennung für etwas Gutes, jemandem [für etwas] Dank sagen), so für is a member of the formula, as vor joins Angst haben, and stays out of the normalized Surface vielen Dank; Ihre Hilfe is free (de/governed-preposition-joins-its-governor). An INTJ records no valencyEvidence, so the member carries none. Ruled 2026-10-02 (#701, grouping audit Q1). Knowledge (#884): Formula Role Thanks; no Locution Type, as guten Tag; synonyms danke, danke schön and danke sehr from the OpenThesaurus synset. Decided by agents under the user's delegation."
